---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const breadcrumbs = [
  { name: 'Home', url: 'https://aajkitazakhabar.pages.dev/en/' },
  { name: 'Privacy Policy', url: 'https://aajkitazakhabar.pages.dev/en/privacy' }
];
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | Aaj Ki Taza Khabar"
  description="Transparent overview of data protection, zero third-party tracking, cookie-free analytics, and user privacy."
  lang="en"
  canonicalUrl="https://aajkitazakhabar.pages.dev/en/privacy"
  alternateUrl="https://aajkitazakhabar.pages.dev/ur/privacy"
  breadcrumbs={breadcrumbs}
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto py-6 space-y-8">
    <header class="border-b border-neutral-800 pb-4">
      <span class="text-xs font-bold text-red-500 uppercase tracking-wider">Data Protection</span>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-white mt-1">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-neutral-400 text-sm mt-2">
        Last updated: October 2026. We respect reader anonymity and collect minimal technical data.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="prose prose-invert prose-red max-w-none text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed space-y-6 text-sm sm:text-base">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white border-b border-neutral-800 pb-2">1. Minimalist Data Collection</h2>
      <p>
        Aaj Ki Taza Khabar does not require reader registration, account logins, paywalls, or personal information capture. You can access all articles freely and anonymously without disclosing your identity.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white border-b border-neutral-800 pb-2">2. Analytics & Cookies</h2>
      <p>
        We employ privacy-preserving analytics (Cloudflare Web Analytics) which does not use client tracking cookies, does not track individual IP addresses across other websites, and does not build advertising profiles. Metrics collected are strictly aggregate page request counts and anonymous device categories.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white border-b border-neutral-800 pb-2">3. Advertising</h2>
      <p>
        Advertising network scripts are currently disabled across our entire platform. We do not sell, rent, or lease personal identifiers to third-party ad brokers.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white border-b border-neutral-800 pb-2">4. Contact Inquiries</h2>
      <p>
        When readers contact our editorial desk via email, submitted email addresses and message contents are retained solely for editorial verification or correction resolution, and are never shared.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
